"both a matching write and a mismatched device/ISO pair (`ChecksumMismatch`), "
"via the E9 hdiutil-image tests on macOS (Linux loop-device equivalents "
"written the same way, exercised by CI). The full CLI path -- device "
"resolution, `sudo` elevation, progress bar, final printout -- was manually "
"run end-to-end on this Mac against a real physical USB drive: `argos write` "
"then a separate `argos verify` invocation both reported the same SHA-256 "
"(`e73a6241...`), matching Alpine's published checksum."
